Chapter: ConstraintMatch
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 A Show a => function whose body is a `when` match still dispatches the
 show call inside the arm (rewrite descends into match arms).

Section: Types

  Pair =
    | Both (Integer) (Integer)
    deriving Show

Section: Body

  describe : Show a => a -> Text
  describe (x) =
    when x
     is otherwise -> "<" & show x & ">"

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (describe (Both 1 2))
    print-line-uni (describe 7)
  end

